--- !u!114 &534761976
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 534761972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cdd1c6f6203178409de95432885bc10, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _indicator: {fileID: 384412498}
  Dialogue:
  - "The player character, the Lie, is told by Sigyn that they are to \u201Cdestroy
    Odin\u2019s guardians\u201D to free their father. That is their purpose which
    you shall achieve. They quickly meet the Aesir Bragi, god of poets. He serves
    as the game\u2019s narrator and is enamoured with the story of the Lie. He guides
    the Lie towards their ultimate goal of freeing Loki."
  - "Odin\u2019s guardians are his ravens, Huginn and Muninn, who are keeping watch
    over Loki so he remains in captivity. As the Lie meets them, they warn that freeing
    Loki will cause Ragnar\xF6k, but the Lie pushes on. After defeating both of the
    Ravens, the path to freeing Loki is clear."
