--- !u!114 &1936416982
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1936416980}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cdd1c6f6203178409de95432885bc10, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _indicator: {fileID: 1727348250}
  Dialogue:
  - "You are playing a game inspired by Norse mythology. Baldur has died and Loki,
    the titular Father of Lies, has been captured, as occurs in the mythology. In
    this game Sigyn, Loki\u2019s wife, has created the character you are playing,
    born of his blood. They are the Child of Lies, known as the Lie, carrying the
    essence of Loki and some of his children; Fenrir and Hel."
  - "The Lie shares their father\u2019s shapeshifting ability, but they are seemingly
    only able to swap between the form of the Wolf (Fenrir) and the Sorceress (Hel).
    As the Wolf, they are strong, masculine and protective. As the Sorceress they
    are regal, feminine and capable of witchcraft. These forms do slightly change
    their personalities, but they are not different personalities on their own."
